              description: 'When you cannot play from hand, ask the player to your left for a tile that matches an open end of your line. If they have a matching tile they must sell it to you for 1 chip (seller chooses which tile if they have several). If not, ask the next player clockwise until someone sells or no one has it. Add the bought tile to your line.',
